1
00:05:46,666 --> 00:05:52,666
The story of four souls who needed a body and one guy who needed some soul.

2
00:11:33,333 --> 00:11:39,333
Heart and Souls is a fantasy, comedy, romance film directed by Ron Underwood.

3
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
A fateful night in 1959, four people die when the bus they are riding crashes.

4
00:23:06,666 --> 00:23:12,666
They continue as ghosts; their souls become eternally entwined to the life of
a child born at the moment of their deaths as his guardians.

5
00:28:53,333 --> 00:28:59,333
Baby Thomas grows up to be a businessman who has memories of his playmates,
but assumes they are products of his youthful imagination.

6
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
When the ghosts realize they need Thomas' help to move on to the
afterlife, they decide to make an appearance once more.

7
00:40:26,666 --> 00:40:32,666
Thomas Reilly, played by Robert Downey Jr..

8
00:46:13,333 --> 00:46:19,333
Harrison Winslow, played by Charles Grodin.

9
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
Penny Washington, played by Alfre Woodard.

10
00:57:46,666 --> 00:57:52,666
Julia, played by Kyra Sedgwick.

11
