Milo Peck, played by Tom Sizemore.

12
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
Hal the Bus Driver, played by David Paymer.

13
01:15:06,666 --> 01:15:12,666
Heart and Souls is a 1993 American fantasy
comedy-drama film directed by Ron Underwood.

14
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
The film stars Robert Downey Jr.

15
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
as Thomas Reilly, a businessman recruited by the souls of four deceased people, his guardian angels from childhood,
to help them rectify their unfinished lives, as he is the only one who can communicate with them.

16
01:32:26,666 --> 01:32:32,666
The film explores themes of businessman, afterlife, san
francisco, california, supernatural, redemption.

17
01:38:13,333 --> 01:38:19,333
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
